,\\n  drops out of pickup range for the AI, cutaway invalidating explicit targets, x-ray mask missing tall runs (engine guesses a 120 px box:\\n  runs now pass an exact `box`), stair ramp needs the leading edge, AI stood on wall tops, AI blocked by an open modal dialog.\\n- Cutaway = roof radius (6.5) + a see-through slot toward the camera for tall terrain in front (the Hollow rim, crags).\\n- Autopilot: autoTalk (reads dialogs; Play.update calls ai.readTalk), collect() walks over drops, fails fast out of reach.\\nEOF\\necho ok\",\"description\":\"Record progress in the dev log\"}},\"wire_ingest_context\":{\"toolu_01JDPnrNzzXbt9E49Ajhj7cv\":{\"cwd\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261103-215521__x5b1962/work/DragonQuiltBuilders-DragonQuestBuilders-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261103-215521\"}}}"," {\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01JDPnrNzzXbt9E49Ajhj7cv\",\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"ok\",\"is_error\":false}]},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"9acc64b9-af41-4198-9bbd-536ec13fbed1\",\"uuid\":\"554f8f75-61e4-4d55-ae24-f7d52fd4ca96\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-04T07:04:06.814Z\",\"tool_use_result\":{\"stdout\":\"ok\",\"stderr\":\"\",\"interrupted\":false,\"isImage\":false,\"noOutputExpected\":false,\"bashEditDiff\":{\"files\":[{\"filePath\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261103-215521__x5b1962/work/DragonQuiltBuilders-DragonQuestBuilders-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261103-215521/DEVLOG.md\",\"hunks\":[{\"oldStart\":26,\"oldLines\":3,\"newStart\":26,\"newLines\":12,\"lines\":[\" - 13 VoxelBody {x,y,z,vx,vy,vz,r,h,step,gravity,onGround,fly,blockDoors,inWater,fell,lastSafe}: update(dt,w), jump(v), push, toSafe(), cx/cy/L\",\" - 14 input: DQ.Controls.PLAY/MENU/NAMES, install(game), intent(game,ctx,dt), blank(), wheelSteps(), mouseActive(game); DQ.Glyphs.draw(g,game,action|'@Code',x,y), width, text(g,game,'{btn:swing} Break',x,y,color), measure, 