ores a ledge above the step\\nPASS 01 groundAt over a 1-block step from above\\nPASS 01 ceilingAt finds the block bottom\\nPASS 01 collide: a wall stops a body\\nPASS 01 collide: a 2-high gap passes\\nPASS 01 collide: a 1-high gap blocks a 28-tall body\\nPASS 01 stairs: walking up a ramp onto the next block\\nPASS 01 deep water blocks the builder\\nPASS 01 raycast down hits the top block with an up normal\\nPASS 01 pickScreen finds a block from its top centre in 4 turns x 2 views\\nPASS 01 world generation is deterministic\\nPASS 01 diff and applyDiff round trip\\nPASS 01 runs split around air\\nPASS 01 a body standing on a run sorts after it, and before the roof run above\\nPASS 01 the hollow start, banner spot and spire top are standable\\nPASS 01 the knot wall stands 17 high, with a 3 x 5 gate\\nPASS 01 every portal stands on the ground\\nPASS 02 walk speed matches the tuning (~78/s)\\nPASS 02 the walk slider changes speed live\\nPASS 02 a jump rises more than 1 block and less than 2\\nPASS 02 stone is too tough for the darning stick\\nPASS 02 the cobble club breaks stone\\nPASS 02 the broken block drops into the bag\\nPASS 02 placing a block uses one from the bag\\nPASS 02 no block may be placed inside a body\\nPASS 02 reach: a cell 9 blocks away is out of reach\\nPASS 02 Builder's Eye cursor steps and rises\\nPASS 02 the swing combo hurts a monster in the arc\\nPASS 02 Spin Stitch hits all around\\nPASS 02 KO respawns at the banner with full HP\\nPASS 02 the Lost Bundle holds half of each material stack\\nPASS 02 falling into the Unravel returns to the last safe spot\\nPASS 02 eating a bun fills the belly\\nPASS 02 no errors\\nPASS 03 keyboard prompt for swing is J\\nPASS 03 mouse prompt for swing is the left button\\nPASS 03 mouse prompt for place is the right button\\nPASS 03 gamepad prompt for swing is square (button 2)\\nPASS 03 the glyph setting switches to Xbox\\nPASS 03 PlayStation glyphs are the default family\\nPASS 03 the mouse wheel steps the hotbar\