{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says (TASK.md describes the game). Done when: the bundled single .html file exists in this folder's root, every feature in TASK.md is implemented with no TODOs, placeholders or stubs, exit-interview.json in this folder's root parses as JSON and answers every field, and your final reply contains the Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections.]: The html and exit-interview.json exist and parse, and the final reply has the four sections. But the transcript admits gaps against TASK.md's 'every feature implemented' requirement: the final reply itself says the island map is 'a tile map with pins, not the plan's full set of landmarks' and that AI rallies 'can still run to about 20 touches'. Postcards are saved as pictures rather than specs, and the plan's motion-capture clips were not used. The 'no placeholders or stubs' check is also unverified: the test that greps src/ for TODO/TBD/placeholder only ran as part of the suite, and the source was never checked for stubbed features against the full feature list. The condition's requirement that every feature in TASK.md is implemented is not clearly met by the transcript evidence."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7b48fecc-086c-4274-afae-e17752649adf","uuid":"9a0e2c22-4cdc-4ba2-944b-c56aa4778638","timestamp":"2026-11-04T07:24:31.293Z","isSynthetic":true}
